// Module c-paraneoplastic: paraneoplastic neurological syndromes under the 2021 updated
// criteria (high- and intermediate-risk phenotypes, why the neurological syndrome often comes
// first, the PNS-Care score at a principles level, definite, probable, and possible PNS), then
// high-, intermediate-, and lower-risk antibodies, matching antibodies to cancers, serum versus
// CSF testing, line blot pitfalls, and antibody-directed cancer screening with repeat screening.
// Antibody details are kept consistent with content/antibodies.ts.

